# Add files here to ignore them from prettier formatting
.prettierignore
/dist
/coverage
/.nx/cache
/.nx/workspace-data
.nx/self-healing
# React Router writes its bundle to <app>/build and its route types to
# <app>/.react-router, both on every build. Formatting generated output
# just gets reverted by the next run.
**/build
**/.react-router
# Written by `nx release` for every package it versions. Its renderer emits
# two spaces after the breaking-change marker and before the commit link,
# and prettier collapses both to one, which makes the formatter a second
# producer of the file.
**/CHANGELOG.md
# The docs app's Next build cache and static export, rewritten on every
# `next build`.
apps/docs/.next
apps/docs/out
apps/docs/next-env.d.ts
# Guard fixtures are data the docs guards read line by line, and their tests
# assert source line numbers. A fence prettier pads with a blank line moves
# every line after it.
tools/repo-checks/src/__fixtures__
# The 0.3 Docusaurus pages from 6d5e4f3 that the docs snapshot overlay copies
# over the originals (docs spec §15.2), and the 0.3 landing page, changed only
# in its logo path. Each copy differs from its original only by its
# corrections, and a format pass would rewrite the other lines.
apps/docs/snapshot/docs
apps/docs/snapshot/src
